  "notes": "{掘|ほ}る means to dig into the ground or excavate.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes を particle: ⟦{穴|あな}→穴：01691_ana⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{掘|ほ}る\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{穴|あな}→穴：01691_ana⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{掘|ほ}る: to dig a hole\n- ⟦{井戸|いど}→井戸：03977_ido⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{掘|ほ}る: to dig a well\n- {掘|ほ}り⟦{出|だ}す→出す：01087_dasu⟧: to dig up, to unearth\n- {掘|ほ}り⟦{起|お}こす→起こす：01234_okosu⟧: to excavate\n- {掘|ほ}り⟦{下|さ}げる→下げる：00807_sageru⟧: to dig deeper\n\nWATCH OUT:\n- ⟦{彫|ほ}る→彫る：00114_horu⟧ (to carve) has the same reading but different meaning.\n- {掘|ほ}る: to dig OUT from the ground\n- ⟦{彫|ほ}る→彫る：00114_horu⟧: to carve INTO a surface",
